<title>FINLAND: TABLE- ENSO H1 PROFIT DOWN 17 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TABLE- ENSO H1 PROFIT DOWN 17 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			   928 vs 1,116</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.40 vs 3.38</p>
<p> Net sales					 13,776 vs 13,104</p>
<p> Operating profit				 1,304 vs 1,645</p>
<p>NOTE - The median forecast in a Reuters poll for Enso's profit after financial items was for a 955 million markka profit (range FIM 675 million to 1.03 bln).</p>
</text>
